    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 15th level, whenever the mageknight successfully confirms a critical hit, she gains 1 temporary spell point which lasts until the end of her next turn. This increases to 2 spell points with a x3 critical weapon, or 3 spell points with an x4 critical weapon.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mageknight#toc75\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
